{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>凌晨4時53分，警方接獲途人報案，指灣仔謝斐道404至406號地下一間辣蟹食肆，冒出濃煙及一度傳出爆炸聲。消防接報到場開喉灌救，約38分鐘後將火救熄，經調查後相信起火原因無可疑，初步懷疑有人燃點蚊香肇禍，事件中無人受傷及毋須疏散。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T04:43:12.860784+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:02:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T17:17:55.240226+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T04:36:46.319284+00:00","content_hash":"ac634b33921efa68a0c8435a09bade1e776c76ca5d65b02c5e16a65ba9e24af0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}